{"product_id":"blue-raspberry-ice-i-love-salts","title":"Blue Raspberry Ice by I Love Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eBlueberry Raspberry I Love Salts is a fruit and ice blend that competes with the best disposable vape flavors but is sold in an economical 30ml bottle. Perfect for a Vapor Titan or prefilled vape pod kit, the candied goodness of blueberry raspberry never gets too sweet. The tartness balances out the hard candy exterior and the cool finish blends perfectly on exhale. The dose of menthol is light, so fruit vape fans will enjoy this flavor as much as menthol lovers. I Love Salts are available in 2.5 and 5 percent nic strength.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWanna try more flavours? Choose your favourite\u003cem\u003e \u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/i-love-salts-e-juice\" title=\"I love salts\"\u003eI Love Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e from our collection. Else, shop from our \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"Nic salts\"\u003enic salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e collection with more than +150 salts option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"I LOVE SALTS","offers":[{"title":"5.0% (50mg)","offer_id":41670485147703,"sku":"Blue Raspberry Ice by I Love S - 50 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"2.5% (25mg)","offer_id":41670485180471,"sku":"Blue Raspberry Ice by I Love S - 25 mg","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ilovesalt_bluerapsberryice.jpg?v=1747700664","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/blue-raspberry-ice-i-love-salts","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




